                : <span class={cls}>{text}{'\n'}</span>
          ))}</pre>
        </Terminal>
        <p class="term-note">
          Test names are verbatim, with timings removed; the ellipsis stands
          for 17 more passing cases. The full suite, <code>npm test</code>,
          reported 274 tests, 274 passing, on the same commit. The paths
          arrived in kit pull requests
          {' '}<a href={`${kitRepo}/pull/13`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">#13</a>,
          {' '}<a href={`${kitRepo}/pull/16`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">#16</a>,
