  <Section tone="alt" borderTop borderBottom>
    <div class="container">
      <Eyebrow accent="green" gap="sm">What you get</Eyebrow>
      <h2 class="display-md measure-lg section-title">A record of the lifecycle you can inspect without the transcript.</h2>
      <p class="body measure section-copy">
        Every stage leaves evidence that Flow evaluated, and every person-made
        decision leaves a receipt bound to what it decided. After a run you can
        see which stage it stopped at and why, without asking the agent.
      </p>
